    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/releases/tag/11.3.2"&gt;11.3.2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/compare/11.3.1...11.3.2"&gt;&lt;tt&gt;11.3.1...11.3.2&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Enhancements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Documentation – Corrected &lt;code&gt;PointerPointProperties&lt;/code&gt; inline documentation, and exposed it on &lt;code&gt;PointerEventArgs&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/TomEdwardsEnscape/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/TomEdwardsEnscape"&gt;@TomEdwardsEnscape&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3150970802" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19062" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19062/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19062"&gt;#19062&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controls – Remove the need for MenuItem Icon to be a ILogical by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Doraku/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Doraku"&gt;@Doraku&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3153933365" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19075" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19075/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19075"&gt;#19075&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Extend dirty rect when UseLayoutRounding=false by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/MrJul/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/MrJul"&gt;@MrJul&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2941594966" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/18511" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18511/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18511"&gt;#18511&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Properly handle in cluster ShapedBuffer split by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Gillibald/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Gillibald"&gt;@Gillibald&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3159966565" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19090" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19090/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19090"&gt;#19090&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controls – Reverse TickBar when Slider direction is reversed by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/zrt2399/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/zrt2399"&gt;@zrt2399&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3165095855" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19096" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19096/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19096"&gt;#19096&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Android – Better api level detection for display edge to edge and ignore system bar color changes if on api level 35 by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/emmauss/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/emmauss"&gt;@emmauss&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3136822608" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19034" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19034/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19034"&gt;#19034&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Android – Fix oversight with display edge to edge detection for android 16 by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/emmauss/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/emmauss"&gt;@emmauss&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3152928952" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19067" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19067/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19067"&gt;#19067&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Android – Revert changes preventing status bar theme from being updated by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/emmauss/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/emmauss"&gt;@emmauss&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3153965141" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19076" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19076/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19076"&gt;#19076&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Android – Reset android input method focus and connection state when text input focus is removed by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/emmauss/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/emmauss"&gt;@emmauss&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3157064153" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19083" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19083/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19083"&gt;#19083&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;macOS – SuggestedStartLocation is not set if the FileTypeChoices is not null by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Whiletru3/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Whiletru3"&gt;@Whiletru3&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3137200125" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19036" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19036/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19036"&gt;#19036&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;macOS – Respect info.plist values for setActivationPolicy by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/drasticactions/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/drasticactions"&gt;@drasticactions&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3152463222" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19066" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19066/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19066"&gt;#19066&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;macOS – Add shouldResize value to SetWindowState, don't resize on Window move by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/drasticactions/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/drasticactions"&gt;@drasticactions&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3159213865" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19088" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19088/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19088"&gt;#19088&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
